<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ko"><head><jsp:include page="common/head.jsp"/></head>
<body data-page="dashboard"><jsp:include page="common/sidebar.jsp"/><div class="app-shell"><jsp:include page="common/header.jsp"/><main>
<div class="page-title"><div><h1>대시보드</h1><p>기준월별 고객 연체 위험 현황을 확인합니다.</p></div><div class="base-month-picker"><label>기준년<select id="baseYearSelect" data-base-year></select></label><label>기준월<select id="baseMonthSelect" data-base-month></select></label><select id="baseYmSelect" hidden aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></select></div></div>
<section class="metric-grid"><article class="metric"><small>분석 대상 고객</small><strong id="targetCount">-</strong></article><article class="metric danger"><small>고위험 고객</small><strong id="highRiskCount">-</strong></article><article class="metric warning"><small>위험도 상승 고객</small><strong id="increasedCount">-</strong></article><article class="metric"><small>예측 완료율</small><strong id="completionRate">-</strong></article></section>
<section class="split-grid"><article class="panel"><h2>위험등급별 고객 분포</h2><div id="riskDistribution" class="bar-list"></div></article><article class="panel dashboard-risk-panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>예측기간별 평균 위험률 비교</h2><span class="comparison-badge">확대 비교</span></div><div id="averageRisk" class="hazard-bar-list"></div><div class="hazard-chart-scale dashboard-risk-scale" aria-hidden="true"><span>0%</span><span>세 기간 내 상대 비교</span><strong id="dashboardRiskScaleMaximum">-</strong></div><p class="hazard-scale-note">실제 0~100% 막대가 아니라, 매우 작은 평균 위험률의 차이를 확인하기 위한 확대 표시입니다.</p></article></section>
<section class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>고위험 고객</h2><a id="highRiskViewAll" data-customer-list-path="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/customers" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/customers?riskGrade=WARNING&amp;sort=topRiskPercent%2Casc">전체보기</a></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>고객번호</th><th>등급</th><th>1개월</th><th>2개월</th><th>3개월</th><th>전월 대비</th><th>주요 요인</th></tr></thead><tbody id="highRiskTable"></tbody></table></div></section>
<p id="pageError" class="error-message" hidden></p></main></div>
<script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/js/api.js?v=20260830-3"></script><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/js/dashboard.js?v=20260905-2"></script></body></html>
